sAi4S6Kyu.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4145","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42786","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"29288","synopsis":"Ikkou's ghost friend, Yagani, proclaims his love for Kazuki because he likes the feeling of being exorcise by her. However, Kazuki rejects his advances. She challenges Chitose at the school's annual athletics carnival for Ikkou. After a backfired sabotage attempt by Kazuki, she lock herself up in the PE equipment room with Ikkou.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7SmcQvPR67OhODeDEZ6zb3h0VsK.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Ikkou's ghost friend, Yagani, proclaims his love for Kazuki because he likes the feeling of being exorcise by her. However, Kazuki rejects his advances. She challenges Chitose at the school's annual athletics carnival for Ikkou. After a backfired sabotage attempt by Kazuki, she lock herself up in the PE equipment room with Ikkou.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7SmcQvPR67OhODeDEZ6zb3h0VsK.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4145","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42786","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"29291","synopsis":"Hinata, Ikkou, Chitose, Sakura and Kazuki go on a haniwa excavation together. Kazuki shamelessly seduces Ikkou but is constantly thwarted by her fanboys. In a rage, Kazuki accidentally releases an evil spirit, a giant haniwa. Hinata is forced to make her little demon into a monster to destroy the spirit.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lchPHkxPxsBbF3JGlmYnj0Ox1jR.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Hinata, Ikkou, Chitose, Sakura and Kazuki go on a haniwa excavation together. Kazuki shamelessly seduces Ikkou but is constantly thwarted by her fanboys. In a rage, Kazuki accidentally releases an evil spirit, a giant haniwa. Hinata is forced to make her little demon into a monster to destroy the spirit.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lchPHkxPxsBbF3JGlmYnj0Ox1jR.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4145","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42786","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"29295","synopsis":"Jotoku send Hinata and Ikkou to Saichouji, Miyako's temple to allow Hinata to overcome the Six States' manifestation of darkness, her bosatsu, the demon realm. Chitose, Yuuko and Sakura follow them to the temple to be found out by Miyako and sent back to Saienji. Hinata succeeds in suppressing Ikkou after he has awakened to Miyako's dirty play.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rRek8J2F7WpRbvXE46ZOTlZU3iJ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Jotoku send Hinata and Ikkou to Saichouji, Miyako's temple to allow Hinata to overcome the Six States' manifestation of darkness, her bosatsu, the demon realm. Chitose, Yuuko and Sakura follow them to the temple to be found out by Miyako and sent back to Saienji. Hinata succeeds in suppressing Ikkou after he has awakened to Miyako's dirty play.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rRek8J2F7WpRbvXE46ZOTlZU3iJ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4145","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42786","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"29292","synopsis":"After a week of training at Saichouji, Hinata and Ikkou are required to go into Danda Cave, one of the few places close to hell, to complete Hinata's training. Hinata manages to relinquish her ties to her demon associates, with exception of the little demon, for her sister's love. Worried about Hinata and Ikkou, the rest of the gang go to Saichouji to meet them. When Jotoku finds out that the girls have abandoned their chores, she gets Miyako to assign them chores, namely shell-diving in see-through. It is revealed that Miyako is Haruka's older sister.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bxikZJmBRNhoG9tLywI5ksxS0WP.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"After a week of training at Saichouji, Hinata and Ikkou are required to go into Danda Cave, one of the few places close to hell, to complete Hinata's training. Hinata manages to relinquish her ties to her demon associates, with exception of the little demon, for her sister's love. Worried about Hinata and Ikkou, the rest of the gang go to Saichouji to meet them. When Jotoku finds out that the girls have abandoned their chores, she gets Miyako to assign them chores, namely shell-diving in see-through. It is revealed that Miyako is Haruka's older sister.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bxikZJmBRNhoG9tLywI5ksxS0WP.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4145","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42786","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"29293","synopsis":"Cats and dogs are attracted to Sumi's bosatsu, the animal realm. Sumi is locked in the temple while the rest of the gang patrol the temple at night. Kazuki finds out about the situation and joins the patrol to seduce Ikkou. Inspired by Ikkou resisting awakening by Kazuki's seduction, she recites the sutra and manages to calm the dogs down.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dtTlztvRKXBLouQNN7LlafcJsCC.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Cats and dogs are attracted to Sumi's bosatsu, the animal realm. Sumi is locked in the temple while the rest of the gang patrol the temple at night. Kazuki finds out about the situation and joins the patrol to seduce Ikkou. Inspired by Ikkou resisting awakening by Kazuki's seduction, she recites the sutra and manages to calm the dogs down.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dtTlztvRKXBLouQNN7LlafcJsCC.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4145","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42786","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"29294","synopsis":"After a fight with local gang, which uses Ikkou as hostage, Yuuko visits Ikkou in the hospital and gives him food. Ikkou faints after eating. They see a little boy refusing to do surgery because of the absence of his mother. Empathising for the little boy, Yuuko promises to make the little boy a delicious dish so that he can do surgery. They first try niku jaga, a Japanese dish made predominantly of potatoes. After many failed tries they switch to sunnyside up fried eggs. Yuuko manages to make it on her last try and the little boy approves of the end product.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jzgWxdyz6II7woTcNB9twy1KpV6.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"After a fight with local gang, which uses Ikkou as hostage, Yuuko visits Ikkou in the hospital and gives him food. Ikkou faints after eating. They see a little boy refusing to do surgery because of the absence of his mother. Empathising for the little boy, Yuuko promises to make the little boy a delicious dish so that he can do surgery. They first try niku jaga, a Japanese dish made predominantly of potatoes. After many failed tries they switch to sunnyside up fried eggs. Yuuko manages to make it on her last try and the little boy approves of the end product.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jzgWxdyz6II7woTcNB9twy1KpV6.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4145","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42786","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"29297","synopsis":"A baby is left abandoned at Saienji's gate. The gang plus Kazuki attempt to pacify the baby in Jotoku's absence. Kazuki uses the pretext of calming the baby to seduce Ikkou. Haruka, who has a natural talent for calming the baby, is reminded of Miyako looking after her in the past.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ctyXH3UqInpR0xAfvvTAKJtZtrz.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"A baby is left abandoned at Saienji's gate. The gang plus Kazuki attempt to pacify the baby in Jotoku's absence. Kazuki uses the pretext of calming the baby to seduce Ikkou. Haruka, who has a natural talent for calming the baby, is reminded of Miyako looking after her in the past.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ctyXH3UqInpR0xAfvvTAKJtZtrz.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4145","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"886","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42786","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"29298","synopsis":"Kazuki's two subordinates helps Kazuki to seduce Ikkou under different guises. When most of them are foiled by Chitose, Kazuki confronts her and questions her feelings for Ikkou.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6F0BWfd5uaFE27btrD40RgWI60r.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Kazuki's two subordinates helps Kazuki to seduce Ikkou under different guises. When most of them are foiled by Chitose, Kazuki confronts her and questions her feelings for Ikkou.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6F0BWfd5uaFE27btrD40RgWI60r.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":2,"ext